  "correction": {
    "subject": "Pay application #4 – Alder Street Clinic: corrections needed",
    "body": "Hi Teresa,\n\nWe have reviewed pay application #4 for the period to Oct 31, 2026 on Alder Street Clinic and cannot approve it as submitted. Please correct the following and resubmit:\n\n1. Previous certificates do not match what was approved\n   Line 7 states $518,940.00; $536,220.00 was certified through application #3. Deducting $17,280.00 too little would pay that amount a second time.\n\n2. Requested payment is $17,280.00 more than the verified amount\n   The subcontractor requests $268,470.00. Recomputed from the contract, approved change orders, approved billing history and this period’s line items, $251,190.00 is due. The items above explain the difference.\n\n3. Waiver amount will not match the verified payment\n   The waiver covers $268,470.00, but the verified amount is $251,190.00. If you approve the verified amount, the waiver on file will be for a different sum than the payment.\n\nReply to this email with the revised documents and we will pick it up from there.\n\nThank you,\nLucia Marin\nNorthgate Builders, Inc."
